<title>USA: 50-OFF files Chapter 11 bankruptcy.</title>
<headline>50-OFF files Chapter 11 bankruptcy.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>50-OFF Stores Inc said on Wednesday that it has filed for protection from its creditors under Chapter 11 of the U.S. Bankruptcy Code.</p>
<p>The company's management seeks time to reorganize through steps that could include strategic or financial alliances with third parties or the possible sale of the company or its parts, 50-OFF said.</p>
